{
  "id": "high-contrast",
  "name": "High Contrast",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "mode": "dark",
  "app_mode": "grimoire",
  "author": "Grimoire",
  "description": "Maximum legibility in both light and dark: pure black or pure white surfaces, full-strength text, and saturated accents. Every foreground clears WCAG AAA (7:1) against every background, and the low-contrast greys of the default theme are gone. Follows System, so it tracks your OS setting. Raises luminance contrast only — it does not address colourblindness, which needs more than a change of colour.",
